WEBVTT

00:07:57.363 --> 00:08:00.430
and has gotten somewhat better
than other parts of the world.

00:08:00.463 --> 00:08:02.730
Do you think there's something
cultural in that?

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:05.197
Because the other thing
you talked about at Berkeley

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:08.430
was sort of, the difference between
the pharma industry in India

00:08:08.463 --> 00:08:10.263
versus the rest of the world.

00:08:10.297 --> 00:08:11.463
KMS: So you know,

00:08:11.497 --> 00:08:13.363
there are a number of hypotheses

00:08:13.397 --> 00:08:17.797
in terms of why did the developing world
manage COVID better

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.263
than other parts of the world,

00:08:19.297 --> 00:08:21.763
especially Asia, I would say.

00:08:21.797 --> 00:08:25.163
And I think the reason is
that there are many, many factors.

00:08:25.197 --> 00:08:28.197
One is that we are
a young population, you know,

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:31.997
so I think our demographics
have played to our advantage.